<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's Mavesa 9-mo July 31 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's Mavesa 9-mo July 31 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shr 8.98 bolivars vs 3.63 bolivars</p>
<p>Net 11.051 billion bolivars vs 4.469 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Revs 92.721 billion bolivars vs 77.835 billion bolivars</p>
<p>NOTES: Results are inflation-adjusted.</p>
<p>Mavesa is a manufacturer of consumer brand food and cleaning products.</p>
<p>Twenty common Mavesa shares are equivalent to one American Depository Receipt (ADR). Mavesa ADRs are traded in the pink sheets.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 834405</p>
